      "id": "1941f390c60",
      "title": "Switch to Visible",
      "body": "- Call Verizon: confirm Gizmo watch lines are on a separate standalone account from phone lines\n- Buy 2x iPhone 16e unlocked at Apple.com ($599 each)\n- Transfer data on Phone 1: Quick Start (hold phones together, transfer over WiFi before activating Visible)\n- Transfer data on Phone 2: same process\n- Create Visible account for Phone 1 (need unique email address)\n- Create Visible account for Phone 2 (need unique email address)\n- Activate eSIM on Phone 1: scan Visible QR code, port Verizon number (need Verizon account number and PIN)\n- Activate eSIM on Phone 2: same process\n- Confirm Verizon phone lines cancelled (do NOT cancel manually)\n- Confirm Gizmo watch lines still active on Verizon",
